# ===================
# Third-party binaries (exclude libs, keep headers/source)
# ===================

# GLFW - exclude prebuilt libs
glfw-3.3.8.bin.WIN64/lib-*/

# Tilt Five NDK - exclude libs
third_party/TiltFive/lib/

# ===================
# Keep these (committed to repo)
# ===================
# glad/         - OpenGL loader (generated source)
# glm/          - GLM math library (header-only)
# glwrapper/    - Custom OpenGL wrappers (our code)
# glapplication/ - Custom app framework (our code)
# t5wrapper/    - Custom T5 wrappers (our code)
# util/         - Utility code (our code)
# third_party/TiltFive/include/ - T5 SDK headers
